---
title: Spice Cake
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 55 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@shortening{0.5%cup}
@brown sugar{1%cup}
@white sugar{1%cup}
@eggs{2}
@sour cream{1.5%cups} (with 1 tsp baking soda dissolved in it)
@small dates{1%package} (cut up)
@cloves{1%tsp}
@nutmeg{1%tsp}
@allspice{1%tsp}
@salt{1%tsp}
@flour{2%cups}
@cinnamon{1.5%tsp}
@nuts{1%cup}

Mix and bake in a 9x13 pan at 350 degrees for 55 minutes.
